{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02789",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.07,
      "end_seconds": 3.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.71,
      "end_seconds": 8.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Uh, hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.1,
      "end_seconds": 15.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.03,
      "end_seconds": 22.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Lovely day outside, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.95,
      "end_seconds": 28.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "It is, I almost forgot I was coming here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.93,
      "end_seconds": 32.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 33.76,
      "end_seconds": 36.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "We came because of dizziness on standing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.68,
      "end_seconds": 38.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.27,
      "end_seconds": 48.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "It's been going on for about four days. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.17,
      "end_seconds": 55.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.78,
      "end_seconds": 75.52,
      "duration_seconds": 18.74,
      "text": "Standing definitely sets it off. It happens on and off. Uh, I've had a widespread sunburn-like rash too, for about a week. A sudden high fever was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.36,
      "end_seconds": 80.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.58,
      "end_seconds": 96.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.18,
      "end_seconds": 127.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.89,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 20, pulse is 107 beats a minute. And temperature 37.2, pressure 95 over 60, SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.76,
      "end_seconds": 134.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.35,
      "end_seconds": 139.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.74,
      "end_seconds": 143.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.45,
      "end_seconds": 146.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.86,
      "end_seconds": 171.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "You are very hot, your blood pressure is low and there is a flat red rash over the body and palms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.14,
      "end_seconds": 176.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.81,
      "end_seconds": 185.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So, a few quick ones: sore throat, stiff neck or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.13,
      "end_seconds": 189.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Ah, none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.76,
      "end_seconds": 194.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.15,
      "end_seconds": 197.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.38,
      "end_seconds": 221.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 221.9,
      "end_seconds": 225.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "It's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.84,
      "end_seconds": 228.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.78,
      "end_seconds": 232.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.43,
      "end_seconds": 235.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.4,
      "end_seconds": 237.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Yes, depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.04,
      "end_seconds": 247.32,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Okay, I can see depression in your file as well. How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.85,
      "end_seconds": 251.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.07,
      "end_seconds": 254.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.27,
      "end_seconds": 259.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.02,
      "end_seconds": 300.84,
      "duration_seconds": 32.82,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is possible toxic shock syndrome. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. A viral illness is still possible. I'll request blood cultures, it'll help with possible toxic shock. The treatment will be flucloxacillin, 2 grams, now, single dose. That should help with possible toxic shock syndrome. Remove any tampon, you are going to hospital now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.54,
      "end_seconds": 312.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "I'll also refer you to the emergency team. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.94,
      "end_seconds": 316.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.94,
      "end_seconds": 320.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let's review you straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.45,
      "end_seconds": 325.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.63,
      "end_seconds": 330.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Right, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.76,
      "end_seconds": 336.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.19,
      "end_seconds": 339.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}